<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/header', { title: 'Scatch — every piece its own swatch' }) %>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">The Scatch edit / 001</p>
        <h1>Every piece,<br>its own swatch.</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">Find everyday pieces with a little more colour. Browse the rack, save the ones you love, and keep your picks together in one place.</p>
        <a href="/shop" class="btn btn-primary">Browse the rack</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-swatches" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="swatch-card sc-1"><span class="swatch-label">01 / OAT</span></div>
        <div class="swatch-card sc-2"><span class="swatch-label">02 / CLAY</span></div>
        <div class="swatch-card sc-3"><span class="swatch-label">03 / MOSS</span></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="home-details">
      <p class="eyebrow">A better way to browse</p>
      <h2>Find your next favourite.</h2>
      <div class="content-grid">
        <article class="content-card">
          <span class="content-number">01</span>
          <h3>Explore the rack</h3>
          <p>Browse the current collection and search by name or price to find a piece that feels right.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="content-card">
          <span class="content-number">02</span>
          <h3>Save what stands out</h3>
          <p>Keep your favourites on your wishlist and come back to them whenever you like.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="content-card">
          <span class="content-number">03</span>
          <h3>Keep it all together</h3>
          <p>Your cart and order history make it easy to keep track of the pieces you picked.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
